WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:02.275
Start with a short edge at the top.

00:00:02.445 --> 00:00:05.143
Line up the two long edges and press the fold flat.

00:00:05.313 --> 00:00:06.188
Open the sheet.

00:00:06.358 --> 00:00:08.911
That center crease will guide the next two folds.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:14.321
Bring the top left corner down until its top edge meets the center crease.

00:00:14.491 --> 00:00:15.615
Press the diagonal.

00:00:15.785 --> 00:00:17.019
Do the same on the right.

00:00:17.189 --> 00:00:19.256
The corners should meet just below the point.

00:00:21.450 --> 00:00:22.481
Keep the nose still.

00:00:22.651 --> 00:00:25.698
Bring the left sloping edge all the way in to the center crease.

00:00:25.868 --> 00:00:27.526
Press from the tip toward the tail.

00:00:27.696 --> 00:00:29.967
Repeat on the right to make a narrower point.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:35.263
Bring the two smooth back halves together along the original center crease.

00:00:35.433 --> 00:00:37.558
The folded layers should be on the outside.

00:00:37.728 --> 00:00:40.785
Match the tail corners, then press the long belly fold.

00:00:42.450 --> 00:00:44.753
Leave about three quarters of an inch for a grip.

00:00:44.923 --> 00:00:48.036
Fold one wing away from the body, parallel to the belly.

00:00:48.206 --> 00:00:50.846
Match the other wing, then open them nearly level.

00:00:51.016 --> 00:00:53.676
From the tail, both wings should rise just a little.
